order is content. name it once where the group starts, never per item.

  lookup     alphabetical. flags, keys, options — reader arrives with
             the name already in hand.
  workflow   sequence is the idea. internals, steps, stages.

a group whose order you cannot name drifts on the next edit.

alphabetical is regenerable: sort returns it unchanged, or it drifted.
workflow is not — carry it visibly, numeric prefix (01-, 02-).

a file's sections take the same rule as its lists.
peers with no relation stay as written. not everything is ordered.
